{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_132_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春，晉侯、衞世子臧伐齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"二、公伐杞。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月，邾人戕繒子於繒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"戕猶殘也，梲殺也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"五、甲戌，楚子呂卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"夷狄不卒，卒，少進也。卒而不日，日，少進也。日而不言正，不正，簡之也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"六、公孫歸父如晉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"七、冬，十月，壬戌，公薨於路寢。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"正寢也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"八、歸父還自晉，至檉，遂奔齊。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_132_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_132","textTraditional":"還者，事未畢也，自晉事畢也。與人之子，守其父之殯。損殯而奔其父之使者，是以奔父也。遂，繼事也。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}